gnome-session: systemd-logind instead of ConsoleKit and UPower

GNOME 2.32 powered off, restarted, switched users and reported the idle
state and session type through ConsoleKit, and suspended or hibernated
through UPower; both interfaces are gone.  GsmConsolekit keeps its API
and now talks to org.freedesktop.login1 over GDBus (polkit authorizes at
the call), and gains suspend and hibernate, which the session manager and
the logout dialog use instead of UPower.

